    path: '/api/v0/vault/key',
    inSwagger: true,
    tags: ['vault'],
    summary: 'Set up the caller\'s vault',
    description: 'Re-confirms the caller with password, which carries the auth key of the login password, exactly as PUT /auth/recovery-key takes it; a wrong or missing key is a 403, a raw password is a 426, and nothing is written. The vault key\'s password wrap is opened, and re-wrapped on every password change, with the login password, so a vault wrapped under any other password would be lost at the next change. Then stores the caller\'s first vault key, a random key the client made and wrapped under the login password (wrappedByPassword, at most 512 bytes, with its 16-byte Argon2id salt saltPw) and optionally the recovery phrase (wrappedByPhrase and saltRp, both or neither), with the client\'s kdfParams object. Byte fields are base64 and the body is at most 8 KiB. The key is never replaced here: an account that already has one gets 409, and its wraps change only beside the credential that wraps them, through vaultKey on PUT /auth/password, PUT /auth/recovery-key and POST /auth/recover. Publishes vault_changed to the caller\'s sessions. Shares the sign-in rate limit.',
    parameters: [
      ApiParameter(
        name: 'body',
        location: ApiParameterLocation.body,
        required: true,
        type: 'object',
        description: 'The caller\'s auth key and the wrapped vault key; createdAt and updatedAt are ignored',
      ),
    ],
    requestSchema: '{"type":"object","properties":{"createdAt":{"type":"string"},"kdfParams":{"description":"KdfParams is the client\'s JSON object recording the Argon2id cost.","type":"object"},"password":{"description":"Password is the standard base64 auth key of the caller\'s login\\npassword, as DELETE /auth/account and PUT /auth/recovery-key take it.","type":"string"},"saltPw":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}},"saltRp":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}},"updatedAt":{"type":"string"},"wrappedByPassword":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}},"wrappedByPhrase":{"description":"WrappedByPhrase and SaltRp are both present or both absent.","type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}}}}',
    responses: [
      ApiResponse(
        status: '201',
        description: 'Created',
        schema: '{"type":"object","properties":{"createdAt":{"type":"string"},"kdfParams":{"description":"KdfParams is the client\'s JSON object recording the Argon2id cost.","type":"object"},"saltPw":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}},"saltRp":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}},"updatedAt":{"type":"string"},"wrappedByPassword":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}},"wrappedByPhrase":{"description":"WrappedByPhrase and SaltRp are both present or both absent.","type":"array","items":{"type":"integer"}}}}',
      ),
      ApiResponse(
        status: '400',
